{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h1><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<p>The roots of the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/6/0561d206b22c2c257323a06ef53126f4e994d486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2 + bx + c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"130\" height=\"16\" /> will be reciprocal if:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/2/982ca6b8db7b3151ba3d40d71ecb4b81f1e3c4db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a = b \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ a = bc \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ c = a \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ c = b \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ c = ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"526\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Dividing both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/7/077e8e4319e28a8c6572d8c75f672db6bafbd0cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\quad(a\\neq0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"85\" height=\"20\" /> gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/8/e38c446b604df01727a30453ab3cfa72b49b355c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+\\frac{b}{a}x+\\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"98\" height=\"37\" />. \n</p><p>Letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> be the respective roots to this quadratic, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/a/7ba9dbc67c28ce4e2114d76827426c3444078150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r=\\frac{1}{s} \\Rightarrow rs=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>From <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s\">Vieta's</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/e/0ee2b9209841b8ecd9dcccefbdccbb8560acbe85.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rs=\\frac{c}{a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"53\" height=\"33\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/a/51a6c1f395662dae6a6cb5a14eb45e98926ed4b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c}{a}=1\\Rightarrow\\boxed{\\text{(C) }c=a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"160\" height=\"34\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME\" title=\"1956 AHSME\">1956 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1956 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1956\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1956 AHSME Probl